WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,740
Article 1: No shooting is allowed without my order.

2
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:08,610
Article 2: Someone really stepped into Baihua ditch with a gun

3
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,980
Then don't let him out

4
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:24,710
What kind of gun does he have?

5
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:30,220
Eight hundred meters, not our gun

6
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,620
Those who eat sheep rice

7
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:33,220
Brother Changsheng, what should I do?

8
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:37,140
You take people and drive right along Ganggou for 30 meters.

9
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,540
In ten minutes, six guns will shoot the name together

10
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:42,060
But at 800 meters, we can’t be sure.
